 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- **Project PHP extension profiles.** Set `[php] extensions` to the extensions available on your deployment target. Completion and built-in lookup keep project polyfills and exclude unavailable extension declarations after restarting the service. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
+
 ### Fixed
 
 - **Built-in classes follow older PHP targets.** Classes introduced in a later PHP release no longer appear in completion or return through another stub loaded into memory. Project-defined polyfills remain available.
